{"resourceIdentifier":"4650","resourceName":"CBG GENERATION FROM MSW","description":"The project activity aims to improve municipal solid waste (MSW) management through the\r\ninstallation of an anaerobic digestion system to generate Compressed Biogas (CBG) in the city\r\nof Indore, Madhya Pradesh in India. The installed capacity of the project is to treat 500TPD of\r\nsegregated MSW to generate approx. 42,500 N-m3/day of CBG. CBG generated is purified and\r\nprocessed for various thermal applications such as use in vehicles use for transportation or\r\nbottled for use in Industrial energy applications. Technical details of the equipment installed\r\nin the project are provided in section 1.11 of this PD.\r\nThe project is implemented by Indo Enviro Integrated Solutions Private Limited (IEISL). The\r\nproject is commissioned on 22-May-2022 and is in operation since.\r\nIn the absence of the project activity, MSW would be left to decay in the landfill site without\r\nany controlled treatment and such decay would lead to methane emission, a greenhouse gas,\r\ninto the atmosphere. CBG generated in the project is a direct replacement of fossil fuels (e.g.\r\nCNG) used in the baseline. CNG combustion in the baseline would have resulted into CO2\r\nemissions.","location":{"latitude":22.676472,"longitude":75.926220},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-02-07","endExclusive":"2024-03-09","endInclusive":"2024-03-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4650"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Madhya Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Indo Enviro Integrated Solutions Private Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"India"},{"type":"string","value":"sshrivastava@everenviro.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"48710"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"16/05/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 27/05/2022 - 26/05/2032"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=95818&IDKEY=lq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhl132133022","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1 (1).pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-21T04:11:57.757Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=107233&IDKEY=kiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3a147874307","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4650_18AUG2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-02-07T14:46:15.62Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=131959&IDKEY=f98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d8181971461","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS 4650 Project Description.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-05-16T19:20:27.993Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=116340&IDKEY=fiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfe160432860","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Registration deed (VCS4650).pdf","uploadDate":"2024-07-25T08:43:44.157Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.